  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.43 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Psychologists",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.43 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Psychologists. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.43, below, shall apply to the professions regulated by the board of psychologists under RSA 329-B:\n\nTable 1002.43 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Psychologists\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nPsychologist license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $330\n\nRenewal of inactive license | 2 years | $165\n\nPsychologist tele-pass license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $330\n\nRenewal of inactive license | 2 years | $165\n\nSchool psychologist-doctoral license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $170\n\nRenewal of inactive license | 2 years | $85\n\nSchool psychologist-specialist license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $170\n\nRenewal of inactive license | 2 years | $85\n\nPsychologist providing services in response to a declared disaster-temporary registration application processing and licensing | max. 60 days/year | $150\n\nSchool psychologist providing services in response to a declared disaster-temporary registration application processing and licensing | max. 60 days/year | $150\n\nPsychologist-temporary license application processing and licensing | max. 90 days/12-month period | $150\n\nPsychologist-temporary license for forensic evaluations application processing and licensing | max. 30 days in 12-month period | $150\n\nSchool psychologist-doctoral-temporary license application processing and licensing | 12 months, during which can practice 30 days | $40\n\nSchool psychologist-specialist-temporary license application processing and licensing | 12 months, during which can practice 30 days | $40\n\nSource. #13703, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
}
